{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/723","id":4750201960,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGyJUaA","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/723","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/723.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/723.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/723","number":723,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(coachless): idempotent coach-code redemption, routes, module (COACHLESS split 3/3 of #657)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"COACHLESS split 3/3 of #657 (A1-COACHLESS). B-SPLIT-COACHLESS-121 (agent 121). Draft. Base: split 2/3.\n\n## Tier header\n- **Tier:** T4\n- **Why:** Client attach write path (coach-code redemption through the canonical tenancy writer `InviteCodesService.attachUserToCoachByCode`, unchanged), Idempotency-Key ledger, owner admin config route `PUT /admin/featured-coach` (audited), new client routes.\n- **T4 trigger scan:** Auth/tenancy: YES (User.coach_id via the canonical writer; JwtAuthGuard + CoachlessFeatureGuard; OwnerGuard + @Roles('owner') on admin). Money-adjacent: YES (redeem response names the featured package / packages for checkout hand-off; no checkout here). Idempotency: YES. CI gate: no.\n- **T3 trigger scan:** Routes: `GET /coachless/home`, `POST /coachless/coach-code/check`, `POST /coachless/coach-code/redeem`, `POST /coachless/roman-card/seen`, `POST /coachless/roman-card/not-now` (all 404 `coachless_disabled` while the flag is off, throttled), `GET/PUT /admin/featured-coach`. Module registration in app.module.\n- **Bounded T1:** src/coachless/README.md.\n- **Canonical builder:** B-SPLIT-COACHLESS-121 (agent 121).\n- **Parent owner:** operator agent 121.\n- **Acceptance evidence:** `test/coachless/coach-code-redemption.spec.ts` (attach, replay, key reuse 422, concurrent duplicate, stale reclaim, error mapping), roles-enforced, no-pii-in-logs; full suite in this PR's CI.\n- **Promotion triggers:** as split 2/3.\n\n## Contents (1,117 lines: +1,116/-1; 751 non-test)\n| File | Lines |\n|---|---|\n| src/coachless/coach-code-redemption.service.ts (main-merge resolution 5) | 381 |\n| src/coachless/coachless.dto.ts | 117 |\n| src/coachless/coachless.controller.ts (+ inherited-red fix 6) | 159 |\n| src/coachless/coachless.module.ts, src/app.module.ts | 29 |\n| src/coachless/README.md | 65 |\n| test/coachless/coach-code-redemption.spec.ts | 356 |\n| test/coachless/coachless-fixture.ts (restores the M file) | 9 (+8/-1) |\n\nOverlap rule with #658 (invite-code tools): whichever of #657's stack and #658 lands second maps #658's new `code_revoked` / `code_expired` / `code_exhausted` attach codes in `ATTACH_TO_COACHLESS` (src/coachless/coach-code-redemption.service.ts:46-53). Not mapped here (split only; #658 is not on main).\n\n## Split provenance\n- Original: #657 (`annex/a1-coachless-be`) @ `c25960a8b82ed4dd6bea0b7da9f1d77ce783078d` (27 files, +3,184; never reviewed: no AUDIT or FIX ROUND comments, only bot comments). Prior verdicts: none.\n- Reference merge M = `f3f0d659ecb4ad098ff65f454b8ada12be39a5c9`: merge commit `4a072edfaf6c0e296829e768473d40955fc68642` (#657 + main `5da537d60b5775078c20530829c94d33be2bc527`, conflicts resolved once; `git show --remerge-diff 4a072edf`) plus one commit `f3f0d659` with the two semantic resolutions main's gates require (items 4-5 below).\n- Reference with the listed fixes M' = `fcdc1d6c08481f088377abfea8c9e9b894fc9d31` (branch `agent121/coachless-split-0-merged-reference`) = M + the two inherited-red fixes below (cherry-picks of d90b4842 and e3368cc3).\n- Stack: split 1/3 (base main) <- split 2/3 <- split 3/3. Land as one stack (A5 rule 11), bottom-up.\n- Top-tree equality: `git rev-parse fcdc1d6c^{tree}` == `git rev-parse <split 3/3 head>^{tree}` == `31ad366ffca001ef47446b9ad2374935b0c2f566`; `git diff fcdc1d6c <split 3/3 head>` is empty. `git diff f3f0d659 <split 3/3 head>` is exactly the two inherited-red fixes (+16/-1). The original pieces (5bd16994 / 619c28a6 / 2e649446) had top tree == M tree `0279a4f5`.\n- Every file except one is byte-identical to M in the piece that adds it. The exception: `test/coachless/coachless-fixture.ts` in split 2/3 omits the `CoachCodeRedemptionService` import and construction (that service lands in split 3/3, which restores the M file: +8/-1).\n\n## Main-merge resolutions (all in M; each lives in the piece that owns the file)\n1. `.github/fly-env-desired-state.json` (textual, 2 hunks): union. `FEATURE_COACHLESS_HOME: unset` + its note, next to main's `COACH_WELCOME_SCHEDULER_ENABLED` / `WORKOUT_REMINDERS_ENABLED` (#609). [split 2]\n2. `docs/runbooks/launch-flags.md` (textual, 1 hunk): union; the `FEATURE_COACHLESS_HOME | off | ... unset` row next to main's two #609 rows. [split 2]\n3. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (textual, 1 hunk in rls-live-tests): union; the coachless live RLS step (with its own `NODE_OPTIONS` env) before main's clinic engagement (#609) and data-exports bucket (A-636-1) steps. No step removed or loosened. [split 1]\n4. `src/account-deletion/account-deletion.manifest.ts` (semantic; main's erasure-manifest-coverage gate A-608-1 requires a decision for every user-id column): `CoachCodeRedemption.user_id` delete, `CoachCodeRedemption.coach_id` delete (the ledger row replays the erased coach's card), `CoachlessPromptState.user_id` delete, `FeaturedCoachConfig.coach_user_id` and `.updated_by_user_id` detach (the singleton stays; matches the FK SET NULL). No RESTRICT FKs are involved (all three tables CASCADE or SET NULL). [split 1]\n5. `src/coachless/coach-code-redemption.service.ts` (semantic; main's no-pii-in-logs C-700-2 rule: a new file has no exception-text baseline): the ledger failure-mark log and the unexpected-failure log print `describeFailure(err)` instead of `err.message`. [split 3]\n\n## Inherited red fixed (not lens findings; #657's own CI at c25960a8 was red: run 37082215722)\n6. build-and-test, `test/roles-enforced.spec.ts`: the five `CoachlessController` routes had no `@Roles`/`@Public`. Fix: class-level `@Roles('student', 'coach', 'owner', 'sub_coach')` (same form as OnboardingController). Behaviour unchanged: every account role still reaches the handlers, which already answer non-students specifically (`eligible: false` on Home, `role_cannot_redeem` on check/redeem) instead of a bare 403. Commit e3368cc3. [split 3]\n7. rls-live-tests, `test/rls/coachless-rls.spec.ts` \"anon has no privilege; with one granted the RESTRICTIVE deny still returns zero\": with SELECT granted, anon hits `42501 permission denied for function is_owner` (anon cannot EXECUTE the app.* helpers the permissive policies call). Fix: the case accepts zero rows OR 42501, the rule main's `clinic-engagement-rls.spec.ts` already uses; any visible row still fails. Migration unchanged. Commit d90b4842. [split 1]\n\n## Flags\n`FEATURE_COACHLESS_HOME` stays unset (off). Flag flips are a separate operator PR after the stack lands.\n","created_at":"2026-10-05T20:05:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:25:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6da7b93ffdfcbfbacad4fc0aba8f26329bd65094","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/723/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/723/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/723/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/statuses/8c9943673cd2129732fde9b59aef2c19389d4b6c","head":{"label":"BradleyGleavePortfolio:agent121/coachless-split-3-redeem-routes","ref":"agent121/coachless-split-3-redeem-routes","sha":"8c9943673cd2129732fde9b59aef2c19389d4b6c","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a